This comes from the upstream Arcade sync, so it may be intentional. Confirm it with the Arcade owners before merge.

The default `condition` for the source-index stage changed from empty to `eq(variables['Build.SourceBranch'], 'refs/heads/main')`. Source indexing is now skipped on every `release/*` branch, including release/9.0, which this PR targets. That is a silent behavior change in this repo's pipeline, and the PR description does not mention it.

::diff{file="eng/common/core-templates/job/source-index-stage1.yml" lines="9-9"}

If the main-only restriction is intentional, say so in the PR description. If it isn't, make the condition a parameter that callers can override.
